cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "octalum-bdtb (Brain-Dump-to-Build)"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic CLI and Claude Code Skill that converts unstructured
  brain-dump text into a structured project plan whose outputs slot into
  the github/spec-kit spec-driven-development workflow (spec.md, plan.md,
  research.md, data-model.md, quickstart.md, contracts/, tasks.md) and
  preserve the OCTALUM 8-phase SDLC mapping inside plan.md.
